  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 49a9dd75b14f64f43a98b9b523c7ac90, type: 3}
  m_Name: PlayerCubicle
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  _concurrentDialogue:
  - "My cubicle\u2026"
  - "It\u2019s ironic\u2026 The last to join, and the last to stay\u2026"
  - At some point I loved my job. At some point I hated it.
  - At some point I learned to be okay with it.
  - Everyone on the team made this job worthwhile. I think I never would have been
    able to tolerate this job without them.
  - Sometimes I forget that I take life for granted, and all I did was complain.
  - "That was something Marcy didn\u2019t like about me."
  - Even Dan.
  - But now, every painstakingly long meeting, every time I worked overtime, every
    awkward moment, even now, I miss them.
  - A couple of years ago, if someone would have told me this was the future waiting
    for us, I would have made a snarky comment.
  - "But here we are\u2026"
  - "With nothing more to do, but wait for the end\u2026 "
  _characterName: You
  _nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
  _choices: {fileID: 0}
